alternatively, ambiguously indistinguishable from human intelligence and human consciousness, and if so, (b) is
such an earthly robotic intelligence a kind of consciousness indistinguishable from a presumptive              
extraterrestrial robotic consciousness, and if so, (c) is such a human-created robot preferably able to serve  
as a substitute for or even entirely supplant human intelligence and consciousness in certain exceptionally    
responsible roles? In the course of this investigation of artificial intelligence and consciousness, I also    
